@startuml
title TMFC023: Party Interaction Management -- eTOM/SID ABE Links

class "Customer Interaction Mgmt." as CustomerInteractionMgmt <<eTOM Business Activity>>
class "Business Partner Interaction Mgmt." as BusinessPartnerInteractionMgmt <<eTOM Business Activity>>
class "Communication Interaction ABE" as CommunicationInteractionABE <<SID Data Entity>>

' eTOM activity <-> SID ABE links. Per the image's own legend, an arrow from the
' eTOM activity towards the SID ABE means information produced by the activity;
' the reverse arrow means information consumed by the activity. Each pair here is
' drawn in the image as two separate curved arrows, one each way, so both hold
' simultaneously for both activities.
CustomerInteractionMgmt --> CommunicationInteractionABE : produces
CommunicationInteractionABE --> CustomerInteractionMgmt : is consumed by

BusinessPartnerInteractionMgmt --> CommunicationInteractionABE : produces
CommunicationInteractionABE --> BusinessPartnerInteractionMgmt : is consumed by
@enduml
